    "html": "<h1 id=\"repository-revision-state\">Repository Revision State</h1>\n<p>Stores the last repository baseline that agents used when they verified, upgraded, or synchronized this knowledge base.</p>\n<h2 id=\"version-identity\">Version Identity</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>KB Template Version</td><td>v2.3.2</td></tr><tr><td>KB Patch Revision</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>Version Lineage</td><td>v2.3.2</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Scope</td><td>project-knowledge-base-template</td></tr><tr><td>Source Repository Identifier</td><td>git@github.com:williamduong/project-knowledge-base-template.git</td></tr><tr><td>Source Default Branch</td><td>intent/v2-9-uiv2-shadcn-admin-shell-adoption</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>For downstream project use, the Brand Scope field should identify the product or brand boundary inside which commit comparison is valid. Do not compare commits across unrelated brands or repositories.</p>\n<h2 id=\"current-baseline\">Current Baseline</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Source Repository Git Baseline</td><td>e157d9c61caf325f5816cff25d4987a27b294909</td></tr><tr><td>Baseline Captured At</td><td>2026-05-04</td></tr><tr><td>Last Drift Check At</td><td>2026-05-17</td></tr><tr><td>Drift Status</td><td>drift-detected</td></tr><tr><td>Baseline Scope</td><td>whole repository on main</td></tr><tr><td>Last Reconciled Template Version</td><td>v2.3.2</td></tr><tr><td>Notes</td><td>Sync detected drift. Review report before reconciliation: D:\\Source\\template\\project-knowledge-base-template\\knowledge-base\\.kb\\reports\\sync-report-20260517-041100.md Queue updated: D:\\Source\\template\\project-knowledge-base-template\\knowledge-base\\00-start-here\\strategic-backlog.md</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"machine-state\">Machine State</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CLI Version</td><td>2.3.2</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Mode</td><td>tracked</td></tr><tr><td>State File</td><td>knowledge-base/.kb/state.json</td></tr><tr><td>Content Root</td><td>D:\\Source\\template\\project-knowledge-base-template\\knowledge-base</td></tr><tr><td>Visible Mount Path</td><td>D:\\Source\\template\\project-knowledge-base-template\\knowledge-base</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mandatory-agent-check\">Mandatory Agent Check</h2>\n<p>Before broad maintenance, migration, upgrade, or repo-wide edits:</p>\n<ol><li>Read this file.</li><li>If the repository is not under git, keep placeholders explicit and do not invent a revision baseline.</li><li>If the repository is under git, resolve the current HEAD revision within the recorded brand and repository scope.</li><li>Compare HEAD with Source Repository Git Baseline.</li><li>If they differ, review git history from the stored baseline to HEAD before trusting KB freshness.</li><li>If template version changed since the last reconciliation, run the version patch flow as part of the same maintenance pass.</li></ol>",
