    "html": "<h1 id=\"migrate-vold_version-to-vnew_version\">Migrate v&lt;OLD_VERSION&gt; to v&lt;NEW_VERSION&gt;</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<h2 id=\"why-this-migration-exists\">Why This Migration Exists</h2>\n<h2 id=\"files-to-update\">Files To Update</h2>\n<h2 id=\"behavioral-changes-for-agents\">Behavioral Changes For Agents</h2>\n<h2 id=\"prompt-patch-to-use\">Prompt Patch To Use</h2>\n<h2 id=\"step-by-step-migration\">Step-By-Step Migration</h2>\n<ol><li>TODO</li><li>TODO</li><li>TODO</li></ol>\n<h2 id=\"post-migration-checklist\">Post-Migration Checklist</h2>\n<ul><li>changelog reviewed</li><li>queue and verification defaults aligned</li><li>indexes refreshed</li><li>old assumptions removed</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"rollback-notes\">Rollback Notes</h2>",
