    "html": "<h1 id=\"impact\">Impact</h1>\n<h2 id=\"affected-areas\">Affected Areas</h2>\n<ul><li>Release workflow tooling (<code>tools/</code>, <code>package.json</code> scripts)</li><li>Governance docs and release runbook</li><li>Template version stamps</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"breaking-change\">Breaking Change</h2>\n<p>No.</p>\n<h2 id=\"downstream-risk\">Downstream Risk</h2>\n<ul><li>Low runtime risk.</li><li>Main risk is release-process misconfiguration; guarded by <code>prepublish:version-guard</code>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"impact-signals\">Impact Signals</h2>\n<ul><li>Repeat publish attempt on already published version should fail early with clear guard message.</li><li>Governance commits should not trigger republish without explicit release intent.</li></ul>",
