    "html": "<h1 id=\"intent-v2-3-1-release-publish\">Intent: v2-3-1-release-publish</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<blockquote>Fill in: what this change achieves and why.</blockquote>\n<p>Publish patch release <code>2.3.1</code> that includes governance+tooling hardening after <code>2.3.0</code> was already published. This intent tracks release-only work and explicitly avoids reusing governance intents as publish signals.</p>\n<h2 id=\"plan\">Plan</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>plan.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"impact\">Impact</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>impact.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"staged-files\">Staged Files</h2>\n<blockquote>List files staged in <code>proposed-changes/</code> here as you add them. Mirror path: <code>proposed-changes/&lt;path-relative-to-kb-root&gt;</code></blockquote>",
