    "html": "<h1 id=\"intent-v2-3-6-planned-backlog\">Intent: v2-3-6-planned-backlog</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<p>Add mandatory <code>focus.md</code> end-of-session update step to Workflow 7 (Session Handoff) in <code>kb-root/process.md</code>. Prevents stale bootstrap context like the v2.3.4 drift incident where focus.md was 2 versions behind reality.</p>\n<h2 id=\"plan\">Plan</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>plan.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"impact\">Impact</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>impact.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"staged-files\">Staged Files</h2>\n<ul><li><code>kb-root/process.md</code> — Workflow 7: added step 7 (end-of-session focus.md update rule)</li></ul>",
