    "html": "<h1 id=\"impact\">Impact</h1>\n<h2 id=\"affected-areas\">Affected Areas</h2>\n<ul><li>Layer D runtime intents (<code>knowledge-base/intents/_active</code>).</li><li>Layer E notes governance (<code>notes/</code>).</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"breaking-change\">Breaking Change</h2>\n<p>No.</p>\n<h2 id=\"downstream-risk\">Downstream Risk</h2>\n<p>Low. This is planning-location migration only.</p>\n<h2 id=\"impact-signals\">Impact Signals</h2>\n<ul><li>New v2.4 updates still landing in notes instead of this intent.</li><li>Duplicate plans between notes and intent workspace.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"versioning\">Versioning</h2>\n<p>No package version bump required for this intent.</p>",
