    "html": "<h1 id=\"intent-v2-4-team-gates\">Intent: v2-4-team-gates</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<p>This intent owns v2.4 planning for team gates. It is created from notes migration so new planning updates stop going into <code>notes/upgrade-v2.4-team-gates-plan.md</code> and are maintained here.</p>\n<h2 id=\"plan\">Plan</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>plan.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"impact\">Impact</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>impact.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"staged-files\">Staged Files</h2>\n<ul><li>Source note mapped: <code>notes/upgrade-v2.4-team-gates-plan.md</code></li><li>Target ownership: <code>knowledge-base/intents/_active/v2-4-team-gates/</code></li></ul>",
