    "html": "<h1 id=\"intent-v2-4-intent-schema-migration\">Intent: v2-4-intent-schema-migration</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<p>Dedicated migration track for legacy intent metadata at the v2.4 governance checkpoint. Covers: dry-run preview, full write-path with DELETE_SENTINEL field removal, archive marker-only handling, and <code>kb doctor</code> integration to auto-surface migration need on workspace health checks.</p>\n<h2 id=\"plan\">Plan</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>plan.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"impact\">Impact</h2>\n<blockquote>See <code>impact.md</code> for full details.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"staged-files\">Staged Files</h2>\n<ul><li>src/commands/migrate.js</li><li>src/commands/doctor.js</li><li>src/cli.js</li><li>src/commands/help.js</li><li>test/commands/migrate.test.js</li><li>knowledge-base/src/commands/migrate.js</li><li>knowledge-base/test/commands/migrate.test.js</li><li>template/15-governance/migrations/migrate-v2.3.5-to-v2.4.0.md</li><li>template/15-governance/migrations/README.md</li></ul>",
