    "html": "<h1 id=\"version-estimates\">Version Estimates</h1>\n<p>Generated at: 2026-05-02T12:58:15.991Z Base chaos score: 45.0 / 100</p>\n<h2 id=\"v19-v19-temporal-graph-foundation\">v1.9 — v1.9 — Temporal Graph Foundation</h2>\n<p>Add knowledge graph layer with temporal tracking: kb graph export (JSONL), kb graph check (consistency)</p>\n<h3 id=\"chaos-projection\">Chaos Projection</h3>\n<ul><li>Projected score: 27.0 / 100 (manageable)</li><li>Delta: -18.0</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"phases\">Phases</h3>\n<ol><li>Phase 0 (1 session): Model validation vs v1.7/v1.8 artifacts</li><li>Phase 1 (2 sessions): Schema + relation dictionary definition</li><li>Phase 2 (3-4 sessions): src/lib/graph.js + JSONL export + kb graph export command</li><li>Phase 3 (2 sessions): Consistency checks + kb graph check command</li><li>Phase 4 (1 session): Docs + smoke + release</li></ol>\n<h3 id=\"risks\">Risks</h3>\n<ul><li>⚠ Graph schema complexity — must balance richness vs performance</li><li>⚠ Backward compat: v1.8 catalog must map cleanly to graph</li><li>⚠ Temporal tracking adds 2-3 new fields per entity — migration prep needed</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"dependencies\">Dependencies</h3>\n<ul><li>v1.8.1 chaos foundation (AI confidence metric)</li><li>v1.8.2 refactor status.js (E01 resolved)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"v20-v20-supervised-self-evolution-platform\">v2.0 — v2.0 — Supervised Self-Evolution Platform</h2>\n<p>Agent-centric platform: observability, intent execution, feedback loop, decision autonomy framework</p>\n<h3 id=\"chaos-projection\">Chaos Projection</h3>\n<ul><li>Projected score: 21.5 / 100 (stable)</li><li>Delta: -23.5</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"phases\">Phases</h3>\n<ol><li>Phase 0 (1 session): Observability specification (events, traces, metrics)</li><li>Phase 1 (2-3 sessions): Intent execution engine (plan → staged files → decision context)</li><li>Phase 2 (2-3 sessions): Feedback loop (user input, agent output, decision record)</li><li>Phase 3 (3-4 sessions): Decision autonomy framework (thresholds, confidence bounds, safety gates)</li><li>Phase 4 (2 sessions): Docs + release + migration guide from v1.x</li></ol>\n<h3 id=\"risks\">Risks</h3>\n<ul><li>⚠ MAJOR: Major architecture shift — v1.x clients may need rework</li><li>⚠ Decision autonomy: safety thresholds must be extensively tested</li><li>⚠ Performance: event/trace collection under full KB scope could be heavy</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"dependencies\">Dependencies</h3>\n<ul><li>v1.9 graph foundation (data structure for agent reasoning)</li><li>Stable agent patterns observed across 3+ real projects</li><li>v1.8.x stabilization (no regressions)</li></ul>",
