    "html": "<h1 id=\"kb-4-command-todo\">KB 4-Command TODO</h1>\n<h2 id=\"phase-1---core-cli\">Phase 1 - Core CLI</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] Add <code>kb maintain</code> command and route in CLI.</li><li>[x] Add <code>maintain</code> and <code>maintain:fast</code> npm scripts.</li><li>[x] Simplify <code>kb help</code> default output to 4 core commands.</li><li>[x] Keep full command list under <code>kb help --advanced</code>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"phase-2---safety-rerun\">Phase 2 - Safety + Rerun</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] Add interactive rerun confirmation for <code>kb init</code> when KB content already exists.</li><li>[x] Add <code>--yes</code> flag to bypass confirmation in automation.</li><li>[x] Preserve existing KB content during rerun (refresh mode).</li><li>[x] Add warning when no <code>.git</code> is found and mode auto-falls back to <code>tracked</code>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"phase-3---docs-landing\">Phase 3 - Docs + Landing</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] Update <code>README.md</code> to center user guidance around 4 commands.</li><li>[x] Update <code>template/00-start-here/how-to-use-this-kb.md</code> with 4-command flow.</li><li>[x] Update landing (<code>site/index.html</code>) with no-git guidance and latest install command.</li><li>[x] Add maintain workflow examples in docs.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"phase-4---validation\">Phase 4 - Validation</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] Verify <code>kb help</code> and <code>kb help --advanced</code> output.</li><li>[x] Verify <code>kb maintain</code> full mode in repository workspace.</li><li>[x] Verify <code>kb maintain --fast</code> behavior and warning copy.</li><li>[x] Run quality checks (<code>npm run doc:gate</code>, <code>kb test --all</code>, <code>kb doctor --strict</code>).</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"release-follow-up\">Release Follow-up</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] Update changelog/release notes for UX simplification.</li><li>[x] Publish npm release after validation. (v1.1.2 published 2026-04-30)</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"phase-5-agent-prompt-layer-v120\">Phase 5 — Agent + Prompt Layer (v1.2.0)</h2>\n<h3 id=\"51-agent-rewrite\">5.1 Agent rewrite</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Rewrite <code>template/.github/agents/kb.agent.md</code> thành 3-role: master user / structural guardian / code Q&amp;A oracle.</li><li>[ ] Định nghĩa pipeline Q&amp;A: read <code>code-qa-index.md</code> → load docs → semantic_search source ≤3 hits → cite + confidence.</li><li>[ ] Thêm command surface <code>@kb</code>: <code>audit metadata</code>, <code>enable/disable ide-integration</code>, default Q&amp;A.</li><li>[ ] Document advisory vs strict bi-temporal mode + toggle path.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"52-new-prompts\">5.2 New prompts</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Tạo <code>template/.github/prompts/kb-plan.prompt.md</code>:</li><li>Đọc state.json + template.json + git baseline + strategic-backlog.md.</li><li>Phân loại nhu cầu (init/update/maintain/uninstall/custom).</li><li>Sinh <code>knowledge-base/.kb/runtime-plan.md</code> (markdown checklist + YAML frontmatter).</li><li>Hỗ trợ refine khi user gõ thêm text sau <code>/kb-plan</code>.</li><li>[ ] Tạo <code>template/.github/prompts/kb-run.prompt.md</code>:</li><li>Detect <code>state.json</code> chưa có → auto-init silent (3 biến tự detect).</li><li>Detect <code>runtime-plan.md</code> chưa có → invoke /kb-plan logic + xin xác nhận.</li><li>Lấy step <code>current_step</code>, hiển thị, xin confirm (trừ <code>--auto</code>).</li><li>Chạy step → update plan (mark done, bump current_step, last_updated).</li><li>Lần đầu: detect IDE → inject KB-MANAGED block + in hướng dẫn disable.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"53-template-docs-mi\">5.3 Template docs mới</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Tạo <code>template/00-start-here/code-qa-index.md</code> (map question type → docs).</li><li>[ ] Tạo <code>template/14-templates/extension-mechanism.md</code> (placeholder cho extension/plugin system).</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"54-state-schema-uninstall\">5.4 State schema + uninstall</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Mở rộng <code>state.json</code> schema: <code>ideIntegration: { enabled: bool, targets: [{file, injectedAt}] }</code>.</li><li>[ ] Mở rộng <code>state.json</code> schema: <code>metadataPolicy: 'advisory' | 'strict'</code> (default advisory).</li><li>[ ] Update <code>kb uninstall</code>: xóa <code>.kb/runtime-plan.md</code> + xóa block <code>&lt;!-- KB-MANAGED:START/END --&gt;</code> trong các file IDE đã inject.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"55-cleanup-prompts-c\">5.5 Cleanup prompts cũ</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Xóa <code>template/.github/prompts/kb-build.prompt.md</code>.</li><li>[ ] Xóa <code>template/.github/prompts/kb-maintain.prompt.md</code>.</li><li>[ ] Xóa bản ở root <code>.github/prompts/</code> (downstream cleanup hint trong update logic).</li><li>[ ] Add changelog notice (breaking).</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"56-ide-detection-helper\">5.6 IDE detection helper</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Lib mới <code>src/lib/ide-detect.js</code>: detect VS Code Copilot (<code>.github/copilot-instructions.md</code> exists hoặc <code>.vscode/</code>), Cursor (<code>.cursor/</code> hoặc <code>.cursorrules</code>), Claude (<code>CLAUDE.md</code>), generic (<code>AGENTS.md</code>).</li><li>[ ] Lib <code>src/lib/ide-inject.js</code>: read/write block KB-MANAGED với marker, idempotent.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"57-docs-sync\">5.7 Docs sync</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Update README: thêm section \"Bộ ba CLI + Prompts + Agent\".</li><li>[ ] Update <code>template/00-start-here/how-to-use-this-kb.md</code>: flow <code>/kb-run</code> cho non-CLI user.</li><li>[ ] Update <code>site/index.html</code>: thêm flow \"Chỉ cần /kb-run\".</li><li>[ ] Update <code>site/docs.html</code>.</li><li>[ ] Update TEMPLATE_CHANGELOG.md (v1.1.1 → v1.2.0).</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"58-validation-phase-5\">5.8 Validation phase 5</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] <code>@kb</code> trả lời được 6 nhóm câu hỏi mẫu (file/function/components/database/extension/frontend).</li><li>[ ] <code>/kb-plan</code> trên repo này sinh đúng plan file.</li><li>[ ] <code>/kb-run</code> trên tmp workspace trống: auto-init + plan + run step.</li><li>[ ] <code>/kb-run</code> trên workspace đã init: resume từ current_step.</li><li>[ ] IDE injection test: Copilot + Cursor đều inject + remove sạch.</li><li>[ ] <code>kb uninstall</code> cleanup full.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"59-release-v120\">5.9 Release v1.2.0</h3>\n<ul><li>[ ] Bump <code>package.json</code> 1.1.1 → 1.2.0.</li><li>[ ] Bump <code>template/template.json</code> 1.1.0 → 1.2.0.</li><li>[ ] Update CHANGELOG (cả npm package + template).</li><li>[ ] Smoke test trên downstream sample project.</li><li>[ ] <code>npm publish</code>.</li></ul>",
