    "html": "<h1 id=\"release-v170---2026-05-02\">Release v1.7.0 - 2026-05-02</h1>\n<p><strong>Previous release:</strong> v1.6.0 <strong>Range:</strong> v1.6.0..v1.7.0 (manual — work not yet committed at notes-generation time)</p>\n<h2 id=\"highlights\">Highlights</h2>\n<ul><li>This release introduces the <strong>Intent Foundation</strong> — a structured workflow for proposing, reviewing, applying, and archiving KB changes as intent workspaces.</li><li>Adds the <code>kb intent</code> command surface: <code>create</code>, <code>status</code>, <code>list</code>, <code>apply</code>, <code>cancel</code>.</li><li>Intent workspaces provide a staging area under <code>intents/_active/&lt;id&gt;/proposed-changes/</code> that mirrors the KB content root path structure.</li><li><code>kb intent apply</code> writes staged files, builds an apply-record, archives the workspace, and optionally triggers the release pipeline in one atomic flow.</li><li>Archived intent evidence (apply-record.json) feeds the v1.8 supervised self-evolution loop.</li><li><code>kb release tag</code> now derives <code>intents_applied[]</code> from the archive and writes them into the release ledger entry automatically.</li><li><code>kb status</code> now shows an active intents summary section (count + per-intent detail).</li><li>Doctrine: Recorder role and Evidence Loop defined in <code>template/15-governance/self-evolution-doctrine.md</code>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"changes\">Changes</h2>\n<h3 id=\"features\">Features</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>feat(intent):</strong> add <code>src/lib/intent.js</code> — full intent workspace library:</li><li><code>createIntentWorkspace</code> (quick/full modes, git branch ID suggestion, duplicate guard)</li><li><code>readIntentMeta</code>, <code>listActiveIntentIds</code>, <code>listStagedFiles</code>, <code>validateStagedFilePaths</code></li><li><code>cancelIntent</code>, <code>archiveIntent</code>, <code>archiveFolderName</code> (timestamp-suffix collision guard)</li><li><code>classifyStagedFile</code> (new vs modified detection), <code>buildApplyRecord</code>, <code>applyStagedFiles</code>, <code>writeApplyRecord</code></li><li><code>deriveIntentsApplied</code> (archive scan with lastReleasedAt boundary cutoff, ascending sort)</li><li><code>getActiveIntentsSummary</code> (count + per-intent id/mode/staged_count/has_warnings)</li><li><strong>feat(intent):</strong> add <code>src/commands/intent.js</code> — <code>kb intent create/status/list/apply/cancel/help</code></li><li><code>--mode=quick|full</code>, <code>--change-type=&lt;type&gt;</code>, <code>--yes</code>, <code>--json</code></li><li>Apply flow: validate → warn (no block) if decision_summary empty → +/~ preview → confirm → applyStagedFiles → buildApplyRecord → writeApplyRecord → archiveIntent → optional <code>--release</code></li><li><strong>feat(release):</strong> <code>buildEntryFromTag</code> wires in <code>deriveIntentsApplied(contentRoot, previousReleasedAt)</code> → <code>stats.intents_applied</code> + <code>intents_applied[]</code> in release ledger entry</li><li><strong>feat(status):</strong> active intents summary added to <code>kb status</code> human and JSON output via <code>getActiveIntentsSummary</code></li><li><strong>feat(cli):</strong> dispatch <code>kb intent</code> in <code>src/cli.js</code></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"documentation\">Documentation</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>docs:</strong> update <code>template/00-start-here/how-to-use-this-kb.md</code> — Intent Workflow section (create/status/list/apply/cancel, staged path convention, apply-record, release ledger entry)</li><li><strong>docs:</strong> update <code>template/12-ai-skills/agent-operating-manual.md</code> — Record capability, Evidence Loop entry, Recorder role in Doctrine Alignment table</li><li><strong>docs:</strong> update <code>template/.github/agents/kb.agent.md</code> — v1.7.0 version bump, <code>kb intent</code> command surface, Behavioral Rule #11 (Recorder role)</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"tests\">Tests</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>test:</strong> add <code>test/commands/intent.test.js</code> — 61 tests covering all Phase 1 + Phase 2 functions</li><li>Phase 1 (44): parseArgs, sanitizeId, suggestIntentId, buildIntentMeta, parseIntentFrontmatter, buildPlanStub, buildImpactStub, VALID_MODES, createIntentWorkspace (quick/full/duplicate), readIntentMeta, listActiveIntentIds, listStagedFiles, validateStagedFilePaths, cancelIntent, archiveFolderName, archiveIntent</li><li>Phase 2 (17): buildApplyRecord, applyStagedFiles (new/modified), writeApplyRecord, deriveIntentsApplied (cutoff filtering, sort), getActiveIntentsSummary (count, has_warnings, staged_count), parseArgs apply subcommand</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"issues-addressed\">Issues addressed</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Severity</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>I1</td><td>Medium</td><td>Mirror path validation — <code>validateStagedFilePaths</code> enforces ≥1 dir deep</td></tr><tr><td>I2</td><td>Low</td><td>Warn (no block) if <code>decision_summary</code> empty at apply</td></tr><tr><td>I3</td><td>Low</td><td>Archive folder timestamp suffix guards against collision</td></tr><tr><td>I4</td><td>High</td><td>Apply completes BEFORE <code>--release</code> triggers (enforced ordering in runApply)</td></tr><tr><td>I5</td><td>Medium</td><td><code>intents_applied[]</code> boundary — <code>deriveIntentsApplied(lastReleasedAt)</code> cutoff</td></tr><tr><td>I6</td><td>Medium</td><td><code>plan.md</code> + <code>impact.md</code> pre-filled stubs with headings in full mode</td></tr><tr><td>I7</td><td>Low</td><td>No auto-promotion of lifecycle_state (preserved for v1.8)</td></tr><tr><td>I8</td><td>Low</td><td>+/~ notation in apply preview (<code>classifyStagedFile</code>)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"stats\">Stats</h2>\n<ul><li>New source files: 2 (<code>src/lib/intent.js</code>, <code>src/commands/intent.js</code>)</li><li>Modified source files: 4 (<code>src/commands/release.js</code>, <code>src/commands/status.js</code>, <code>src/commands/help.js</code>, <code>src/cli.js</code>)</li><li>New test file: 1 (<code>test/commands/intent.test.js</code>, 61 tests)</li><li>Test count delta: 198 → 258 (+60 tests, 1 pre-existing from smoke)</li><li>Terminology rule enforced: \"release ledger\" = user-facing; <code>.kb/catalog.json</code> = internal filename only</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"files\">Files</h2>\n<ul><li>src/lib/intent.js (new)</li><li>src/commands/intent.js (new)</li><li>src/commands/release.js (deriveIntentsApplied wiring)</li><li>src/commands/status.js (active intents summary)</li><li>src/commands/help.js (intent apply in usage blocks)</li><li>src/cli.js (intent dispatch)</li><li>template/00-start-here/how-to-use-this-kb.md (intent workflow section)</li><li>template/12-ai-skills/agent-operating-manual.md (Record capability, doctrine alignment)</li><li>template/.github/agents/kb.agent.md (v1.7.0, intent commands, Recorder rule)</li><li>test/commands/intent.test.js (new, 61 tests)</li></ul>",
