    "html": "<h1 id=\"kb-cli-upgrade-plan\">KB CLI Upgrade Plan</h1>\n<p>Based on analysis of the init flow, AI IDE compatibility, and vibecoding effectiveness. Tracked here to avoid holding long context.</p>\n<p>Current scope: <strong>VS Code chat-first</strong>.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"checklist\">Checklist</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>#4 — templateVersion ra JSON file</strong></li><li><code>template/template.json</code> + fallback parser legacy markdown</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>#2 — AI adapter files trong <code>init</code></strong></li><li>Sinh <code>AGENTS.md</code>, <code>CLAUDE.md</code>, <code>.cursor/rules/kb.mdc</code>, <code>.windsurfrules</code>, <code>.clinerules</code></li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>#3 — Hook support trong <code>init</code></strong></li><li><code>--install-hooks</code> to install <code>.git/hooks/pre-commit</code> running <code>kb doctor --strict</code></li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>#5 — <code>kb plan</code></strong></li><li><code>kb plan add</code> / <code>kb plan list</code></li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>#1 — <code>kb bootstrap</code></strong></li><li>Detect stack from source, fill baseline docs</li><li>Added logic to replace placeholder files (not only create new ones)</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>Init auto-flow</strong></li><li><code>kb init</code> runs bootstrap + index by default</li><li>Flag skip: <code>--skip-bootstrap</code>, <code>--skip-index</code></li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>State + Index + Questions + Mark</strong></li><li><code>kb index [--watch]</code></li><li><code>kb questions [--print] [--all-states]</code></li><li><code>kb mark --file ... --state ...</code></li><li>Parser reads <code>kb_state</code> from frontmatter</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>Validation on sample_repo</strong></li><li>End-to-end test with realworld-express + fresh clone</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"tracking-status\">Tracking Status</h2>\n<p><strong>UPGRADE PHASE 1 COMPLETE</strong> ✅ (2026-04-29)</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Main File</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>templateVersion JSON</td><td><code>src/lib/template.js</code>, <code>template/template.json</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>adapter generation</td><td><code>src/lib/adapters.js</code>, <code>src/commands/init.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>bootstrap placeholder replacement</td><td><code>src/commands/bootstrap.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>init auto bootstrap/index</td><td><code>src/commands/init.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>index summary</td><td><code>src/commands/index.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>intake question generation</td><td><code>src/commands/questions.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>per-file state update</td><td><code>src/commands/mark.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr><tr><td>kb_state parser support</td><td><code>src/lib/kb-analysis.js</code></td><td>✅ done</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"phase-2-complete\">Phase 2 Complete</h2>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>normalize-state</strong></li><li>Goal: convert <code>unset -&gt; template</code> across the whole KB to make state model consistent</li><li>Command: <code>kb normalize-state [--dry-run]</code></li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>questions priority by state</strong></li><li>Priority order: <code>needs-review</code> -&gt; <code>autofilled</code> -&gt; <code>template</code></li><li>Reduce noise, focus on questions with high confirmation value</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>bootstrap-api</strong></li><li>Map endpoint docs from actual routes/controllers</li><li>Avoid endpoint template files unrelated to the current domain</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>chat-first intake flow (VS Code)</strong></li><li>Use directly in chat via <code>kb questions --chat --batch &lt;n&gt; --batch-size 5</code></li><li>Question flow: general -&gt; default -&gt; suggest -&gt; custom</li><li>Includes next-batch guidance to run continuously in chat</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[x] <strong>questions chat-batch flow (5 questions/batch)</strong></li><li><code>kb questions --chat --batch &lt;n&gt; --batch-size 5</code></li><li>Format: general -&gt; default -&gt; suggest -&gt; custom</li><li>Includes next-batch guidance for use directly in chat</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"decision-log\">Decision log</h2>\n<ul><li>Do not rename files to represent state.</li><li>State is managed via frontmatter <code>kb_state</code> + index summary.</li><li>VS Code chat-first is the primary UX; CLI is the fallback/dev/CI path.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Current status:</strong> all items in this plan are complete.</p>",
