    "html": "<h1 id=\"v160-phase-0-validation\">v1.6.0 Phase 0 Validation</h1>\n<h1 id=\"date-2026-05-01\">Date: 2026-05-01</h1>\n<h1 id=\"verdict-go\">Verdict: GO</h1>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<p>v1.6.0 Phase 0 artifacts:</p>\n<ul><li><code>notes/v1.6-phase0/release-pipeline.sample.yaml</code> — 13-step pipeline cho npm-package release</li><li><code>notes/v1.6-phase0/dryrun-trace.md</code> — mock-execution với v1.6.0 scenario, 7 issues surfaced</li><li><code>notes/v1.6-phase0/comparison.md</code> — quantitative + qualitative comparison pipeline vs manual</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"goskip-criteria-check-from-113\">GO/SKIP Criteria Check (from §11.3)</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Actual</th><th>Met?</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Steps requiring conscious action reduction</td><td>≥ 50%</td><td><strong>−62%</strong> (13 → 5)</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Pipeline steps with real value</td><td>≥ 8</td><td><strong>12 of 13</strong></td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Copy-paste elimination</td><td>&gt; 0</td><td><strong>−100%</strong></td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Pipeline not too simple</td><td>&gt; 5 steps</td><td><strong>13 steps</strong></td><td>✅</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Verdict: GO — Build v1.6.0 Phase 1.</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"rationale\">Rationale</h2>\n<ol><li>Quantitative thresholds clearly met (−62% actions, −100% copy-paste).</li><li>7 DSL issues surfaced in trace → all are solvable (step ordering, cross-platform cleanup, output capture). None are blockers.</li><li>Qualitative: past copy-paste errors cost real debug time; eliminating this is worth investment.</li><li>v2.0 integration: <code>kb release run</code> as trigger in intent apply final step = clean reuse.</li><li>Solo workflow: pattern repeats every release, pays back in 3–4 releases.</li></ol>\n<h2 id=\"issues-from-v160-phase-0-to-address-in-v160-phase-1\">Issues from v1.6.0 Phase 0 to address in v1.6.0 Phase 1</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Issue</th><th>Priority</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>I1</td><td>DSL must enforce outputs available before consumption (step ordering)</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>I2</td><td><code>kb release notes --output</code> flag existence to verify</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>I3</td><td><code>commit-bump</code> step needs complete file staging</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>I4</td><td>Split push into push-commits + push-tags (partial failure risk)</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>I5</td><td>Avoid double note generation (steps 3 + 5)</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>I6</td><td>Cross-platform cleanup step (Remove-Item → rm)</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>I7</td><td>Verify <code>baseline advance</code> command signature</td><td>Low</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"next\">Next</h2>\n<p>Proceed to v1.6.0 Phase 1 — Pipeline runner (§11.4 task 1.1).</p>",
