    "html": "<h1 id=\"kb-v180-phase-0-validation\">KB v1.8.0 — Phase 0 Validation</h1>\n<p><strong>Plan file:</strong> <code>notes/upgrade-v1.8-supervised-self-evolution-plan.md</code> (v1.1) <strong>Calibration artifact:</strong> <code>notes/v1.8-phase0/calibration-dataset.md</code> <strong>Validation date:</strong> 2026-05-02 <strong>Validator:</strong> KB Project Agent (assisted)</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"calibration-protocol-results\">Calibration Protocol Results</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Actual</th><th>Met?</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Debt items from real repo history</td><td>≥ 10</td><td>12 (D01–D12)</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Entropy items from real repo history</td><td>≥ 10</td><td>12 (E01–E12)</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-version conflict examples</td><td>≥ 5</td><td>5</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Score distribution computed</td><td>required</td><td>debt + entropy tiers assigned</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Provisional thresholds set</td><td>required</td><td>debt_score + entropy_score boundaries</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Detection-only mode default</td><td>required</td><td>no auto-fix in v1.8.0 baseline</td><td>✅</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"threshold-summary-provisional\">Threshold Summary (provisional)</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>low</th><th>medium</th><th>high</th><th>red</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>debt_score</td><td>&lt; 20</td><td>20–60</td><td>60–120</td><td>&gt; 120</td></tr><tr><td>entropy_score</td><td>&lt; 3</td><td>3–10</td><td>10–25</td><td>&gt; 25</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Calibration confidence: <strong>provisional</strong> — to be refined after one release cycle with gates active.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"dataset-quality-assessment\">Dataset Quality Assessment</h2>\n<ul><li>10 of 12 debt items resolved ✅ — confirms items are real and actionable.</li><li>9 of 12 entropy items resolved ✅ — confirms entropy signals are detectable and correctable.</li><li>2 debt items (D10, D11) open → in-scope for v1.8 delivery.</li><li>3 entropy items (E10, E11, E12) open → in-scope for v1.8 delivery.</li><li>No red-tier debt detected in historical data — consistent with absence of catastrophic failures.</li><li>1 red-tier entropy (E01: naming) confirmed real and costly — threshold appears well-calibrated.</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"scope-lock-verification\">Scope Lock Verification</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Concern</th><th>v1.8 scope?</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Debt index schema + scoring</td><td>✅ Phase 1</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Entropy index schema + scoring</td><td>✅ Phase 1</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Lessons schema + lifecycle</td><td>✅ Phase 2</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Gates (detect/warn, not auto-fix)</td><td>✅ Phase 3</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Decision matrix + records</td><td>✅ Phase 3</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Reconstruction trigger workflow</td><td>✅ Phase 4</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Autonomous reconstruction engine</td><td>❌ Out of scope</td><td>deferred v3.0+</td></tr><tr><td>Heavy auto-remediation</td><td>❌ Out of scope</td><td>deferred</td></tr><tr><td>Temporal Graph Foundation</td><td>❌ Out of scope</td><td>v1.9</td></tr><tr><td>Advanced agent intelligence</td><td>❌ Out of scope</td><td>v2.0</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"goskip-criteria\">GO/SKIP Criteria</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Calibration data meets minimum sample size</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Threshold boundaries set without red-zone noise</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Evidence evidence from v1.7 archive is sufficient for Phase 1 schema</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Scope boundaries confirmed with explicit defer language</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>No blocking dependencies on unshipped features</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td><code>npm run test:unit</code> — 258 pass, 0 fail</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td><code>node scripts/doc-gate.js</code> — pass</td><td>✅</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Verdict: GO — Build v1.8.0 Phase 1.</strong></p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"phase-1-implementation-notes\">Phase 1 Implementation Notes</h2>\n<ul><li>Start with file-based storage: <code>knowledge-base/intents/_meta/debt-index.md</code> and <code>entropy-index.md</code>.</li><li>Use integer 1–5 scoring for all dimensions; normalize to tier labels (low/medium/high/red) at display time.</li><li><code>debt_score = (severity × urgency × frequency × strategic_value) / effort</code></li><li><code>entropy_score = (severity × spread × coupling) / reversibility</code></li><li>No CLI command for debt/entropy creation in Phase 1 — markdown-editable files, read by gates in Phase 3.</li><li>CLI read functions needed: <code>readDebtIndex(contentRoot)</code>, <code>readEntropyIndex(contentRoot)</code>.</li><li>Phase 1 exit gate: schemas parse correctly, scores computable from sample data, unit tests pass.</li></ul>",
    "fromCache": true,
