    "html": "<h1 id=\"release-v141-2026-05-01\">Release v1.4.1 — 2026-05-01</h1>\n<blockquote>Manual Phase 0 dogfood. Heuristic per <code>notes/upgrade-v1.5-catalog-release-notes-plan.md</code> §2.3.</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Previous release:</strong> v1.4.0 (574f8b5) <strong>Range:</strong> v1.4.0..v1.4.1 (886a7ba)</p>\n<h2 id=\"highlights\">Highlights</h2>\n<p>Patch release: surfaces <code>kb scan</code> in <code>kb help</code> (basic + advanced) and updates landing site + README to reflect v1.4 shipped state. No engine changes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changes\">Changes</h2>\n<h3 id=\"fixes\">Fixes</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>fix(help):</strong> advertise kb scan — <code>src/commands/help.js</code> lists <code>kb scan [--recursive] [--depth=N] [--json]</code> in basic and advanced help with full description block.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"docs\">Docs</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>docs(site,readme):</strong> v1.4 release content — <code>site/index.html</code> Latest Release card v1.2.11 → v1.4.0 with impact engine summary; v1.3 + v1.4 roadmap cards marked <code>(shipped)</code>. <code>README.md</code> template version v1.2.11 → v1.4.0.</li><li><strong>docs(release):</strong> generate v1.4.1 changelog entry — <code>template/TEMPLATE_CHANGELOG.md</code> v1.4.1 section.</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"chore\">Chore</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>chore:</strong> bump 1.4.1 — <code>package.json</code> 1.4.0 → 1.4.1; <code>version:sync</code> propagated to <code>template/template.json</code> + agent + 3 prompts.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"stats\">Stats</h2>\n<ul><li>Commits in range: 3</li><li>Docs changed (<code>template/**</code>): 7</li><li>Code changed (<code>src/<strong></code>, <code>bin/</strong></code>, <code>tools/<strong></code>, <code>scripts/</strong></code>): 1</li><li>Intents applied: 0</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"files-added-changed\">Files Added / Changed</h2>\n<ul><li><code>src/commands/help.js</code></li><li><code>site/index.html</code></li><li><code>README.md</code></li><li><code>package.json</code> + <code>package-lock.json</code></li><li><code>template/template.json</code></li><li><code>template/.github/agents/kb.agent.md</code></li><li><code>template/.github/prompts/kb-{ask,plan,run}.prompt.md</code></li><li><code>template/TEMPLATE_CHANGELOG.md</code></li><li><code>template/00-start-here/repository-revision-state.md</code> (separate baseline-advance commit)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"migration\">Migration</h2>\n<ul><li>None. Pure docs/help/version-sync patch. Same npm contract.</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<p>&lt;!-- intents_applied: [] (v2.0 will populate) --&gt;</p>",
