    "html": "<h1 id=\"comparison-pipeline-vs-manual-flow\">Comparison: Pipeline vs Manual Flow</h1>\n<h1 id=\"v160-phase-0-analysis-decision-gate\">v1.6.0 Phase 0 analysis — decision gate</h1>\n<h1 id=\"date-2026-05-01\">Date: 2026-05-01</h1>\n<h2 id=\"manual-flow-v15-reconstructed-from-git-history-scripts\">Manual flow v1.5 (reconstructed from git history + scripts)</h2>\n<p>Bước thực tế khi release v1.5.0 (from focus.md + git log observation):</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Action</th><th>Command(s)</th><th>Copy-paste risk</th><th>Error-prone</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Pre-flight validate</td><td><code>npm run release:dry</code></td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Generate release notes</td><td><code>npm run release:notes -- v1.5.0 --from=v1.4.1 --format=md</code></td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (must recall prev tag + new tag)</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Bump version</td><td><code>npm version minor --no-git-tag-version</code></td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Sync versions</td><td><code>npm run version:sync</code></td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Review + paste notes into TEMPLATE_CHANGELOG.md</td><td>Manual editor</td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (cut/paste)</td><td><strong>High</strong></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Stage files</td><td><code>git add package.json TEMPLATE_CHANGELOG.md template/template.json &lt;...&gt;</code></td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (must remember all files)</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Commit</td><td><code>git commit -m \"feat(v1.5.0): ...\"</code></td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (must format commit msg correctly)</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Tag</td><td><code>git tag -a v1.5.0 -m \"Release v1.5.0\"</code></td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (must match version twice)</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Push commits</td><td><code>git push origin main</code></td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Push tags</td><td><code>git push origin --tags</code></td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>npm publish</td><td><code>npm publish --access public</code></td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Update catalog</td><td><code>node ./bin/kb.js release tag v1.5.0 --summary=\"...\"</code></td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (must recall version + write summary)</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>Advance baseline</td><td><code>node ./bin/kb.js baseline advance</code> (or manual edit)</td><td>No</td><td>Low</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Manual total:</strong> 13 steps, 6 copy-paste points, 2 high-error steps (changelog paste + file staging)</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"pipeline-flow-from-release-pipelinesampleyaml-dryrun-tracemd\">Pipeline flow (from release-pipeline.sample.yaml + dryrun-trace.md)</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Step name</th><th>Auto/Manual confirm</th><th>User input needed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>pre-check</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>bump-version</td><td>Auto</td><td><code>--bump=minor</code> (once at start)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>generate-notes</td><td>Auto</td><td><code>--from=v1.5.0</code> (once at start)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>sync-versions</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>update-changelog</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>commit-bump</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>tag</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>push</td><td><strong>Confirm Y/N</strong></td><td>Review output</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>publish-npm</td><td><strong>Confirm Y/N</strong></td><td>Review output</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>github-release</td><td><strong>Confirm Y/N</strong></td><td>Review output</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>catalog-update</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>advance-baseline</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>cleanup-draft</td><td>Auto</td><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Pipeline total:</strong> 13 steps, <strong>2 inputs upfront</strong> (bump type + from_tag), <strong>3 confirm gates</strong> (push/publish/gh-release)</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"quantitative-comparison\">Quantitative comparison</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Manual</th><th>Pipeline</th><th>Delta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Total steps requiring conscious action</td><td>13</td><td>2 upfront + 3 confirms = <strong>5</strong></td><td><strong>-62%</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Copy-paste points (high error risk)</td><td>6</td><td>0</td><td><strong>-100%</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Commands typed by user</td><td>13</td><td>1 (<code>kb release run --bump=minor --from=v1.5.0</code>)</td><td><strong>-92%</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Risk of version string mismatch</td><td>High (typed in 5+ places)</td><td>Low (interpolated from 1 source)</td><td><strong>High reduction</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Risk of forgetting changelog paste</td><td>High</td><td>Eliminated</td><td><strong>Eliminated</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Risk of wrong file staging</td><td>Medium</td><td>Low (pipeline stages known files)</td><td><strong>Medium reduction</strong></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"goskip-thresholds-from-113\">GO/SKIP thresholds from §11.3</h2>\n<blockquote>SKIP trigger: &lt; 30% giảm thao tác GO trigger: ≥ 50% giảm thao tác, ≥ 8 step có giá trị</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Result:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Steps requiring conscious action: <strong>-62%</strong> (exceeds 50% threshold)</li><li>Steps with real value: <strong>12 of 13</strong> (exceeds 8 threshold)</li><li>Copy-paste elimination: <strong>100%</strong> (strong signal)</li><li>v1.6 pipeline yaml: <strong>13 steps</strong> (well above 5-step \"too simple\" threshold)</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"qualitative-signals\">Qualitative signals</h2>\n<p><strong>FOR building v1.6:</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Copy-paste errors (version mismatch, wrong tag in release notes) happened in v1.4 session — wasted time correcting.</li><li>Forgetting <code>git push origin --tags</code> happened once, had to re-push after noticing npm published but no remote tag.</li><li>Changelog paste step requires switching windows + manual formatting — most error-prone step.</li><li>With v2.0 planned: <code>kb release run</code> as a triggered step in intent apply final execution = clean integration point.</li><li>Solo workflow, but pattern repeats every release — investment pays back in 3-4 releases.</li></ol>\n<p><strong>AGAINST building v1.6:</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Only ~1 release/week currently — total time saved per month = 15–20 min.</li><li>v1.6.0 Phase 0 surfaced 7 DSL issues to fix in v1.6.0 Phase 1 — real build cost.</li><li><code>gh release create</code> + <code>npm publish</code> already have good error handling; wrapping adds indirection.</li></ol>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"verdict-recommendation\">Verdict recommendation</h2>\n<p><strong>GO</strong> — Quantitative criteria clearly met (−62% actions, −100% copy-paste, 12/13 valuable steps). Qualitative signals confirm real pain from copy-paste errors in past sessions. v2.0 integration value justifies investment even at low release frequency.</p>\n<p>Blocker to watch in v1.6.0 Phase 1: step ordering in DSL (I1 from dryrun-trace) — this is solvable.</p>",
