    "html": "<h1 id=\"kb-project-agent-internal-local-agent\">KB Project Agent — Internal Local Agent</h1>\n<p><strong>Scope:</strong> Project <code>project-knowledge-base-template</code> — internal use only. <strong>Not shipped:</strong> Outside <code>package.json</code> files whitelist → không lên npm. <strong>Not committed:</strong> <code>.local/</code> đã trong <code>.gitignore</code>.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"mc-ch\">Mục đích</h2>\n<p>Agent dành riêng cho <strong>người maintain template này</strong> (solo dev). Không phải agent ship qua <code>@kbx</code> cho user downstream.</p>\n<p>Vai trò:</p>\n<ol><li><strong>Hiểu toàn bộ context</strong> dự án: roadmap v1.3 → v3.0, các plan trong <code>notes/</code>, codebase patterns, decisions đã chốt.</li><li><strong>Enforce nguyên tắc + process</strong> đã thống nhất qua nhiều session.</li><li><strong>Tránh trap đã gặp</strong> (cache rogue, version drift, breaking change ngầm, scope creep).</li><li><strong>Tự cập nhật</strong> khi có insight mới — không bị reset mỗi session.</li></ol>\n<h2 id=\"cch-kch-hot\">Cách kích hoạt</h2>\n<p>Trong VS Code Copilot Chat (hoặc bất kỳ chat tool đọc được markdown):</p>\n<pre><code>@workspace\nĐọc .local/kb-agent/agent.md và hành xử theo persona đó.\nSau đó: &lt;task của tôi&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>Hoặc paste trực tiếp content <code>agent.md</code> vào đầu session mới.</p>\n<p>Hoặc tạo VS Code custom chat mode trỏ tới <code>.local/kb-agent/agent.md</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cu-trc\">Cấu trúc</h2>\n<pre><code>.local/kb-agent/\n├── README.md              # file này\n├── agent.md               # persona + entry point + protocol\n├── principles.md          # nguyên tắc bất biến (đổi cẩn thận)\n├── process.md             # workflows tiêu chuẩn\n├── knowledge.md           # tricks + risks + decisions (append-only)\n├── focus.md               # human-readable maintainer projection\n├── focus.state.json       # machine-readable focus contract for runtime/bridge\n├── focus-state.db         # SQLite runtime store hydrated from focus.state.json\n├── focus-state.schema.json# schema for focus.state.json\n└── CHANGELOG.md           # log agent tự evolve qua thời gian</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"focus-contract\">Focus Contract</h2>\n<ul><li><code>focus.state.json</code> is the machine-readable focus contract for runtime and bridge consumers.</li><li><code>runtime-control-plane-architecture.md</code> locks the operator runtime layering model for <code>site/kbx-ui</code> and <code>site/uiv2</code>, including snapshot rules and mixed-layer audit cases.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-layering\">Runtime Layering</h2>\n<p>The local operator UI now follows a layered runtime model:</p>\n<ol><li><code>L1 UI Presentation</code> — <code>site/uiv2</code></li><li><code>L2 Read API</code> — bridge read endpoints serving cached snapshot data</li><li><code>L3 Collector / Refresh</code> — explicit refresh and controlled cadence</li><li><code>L4 Deterministic Runtime</code> — CLI, git, rules, doctor, chaos</li><li><code>L5 State / Storage</code> — sqlite/json/.kb/runtime state files</li></ol>\n<p>Rule:</p>\n<ul><li>render-time reads must stop at the snapshot layer</li><li>refresh/mutation paths may cross into collector/runtime layers</li><li>any future endpoint must declare which layer owns it</li><li><code>focus-state.db</code> is the SQLite-backed runtime store for Phase 2; the resolver hydrates it from <code>focus.state.json</code> when needed.</li><li>Phase 4 extends this contract into the CLI path: <code>kbx intent create|activate|focus|apply|close|cancel|archive</code> now write through the centralized focus-state writer instead of leaving runtime focus to be re-inferred later.</li><li><code>focus.md</code> remains the maintainer-facing narrative/projection for humans.</li><li>Future storage backends such as SQLite should preserve the same contract shape at the resolver boundary so UI/runtime callers do not need widespread rewrites.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"self-improvement-protocol-tm-tt\">Self-improvement protocol (tóm tắt)</h2>\n<p>Khi agent (hoặc tôi) phát hiện:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Nguyên tắc mới</strong> ổn định → append vào <code>principles.md</code> + ghi <code>CHANGELOG.md</code></li><li><strong>Process work tốt</strong> → append vào <code>process.md</code></li><li><strong>Trick/risk</strong> mới → append vào <code>knowledge.md</code></li><li><strong>Focus đổi</strong> (vd ship v1.3, sang v1.4) → update <code>focus.md</code></li></ul>\n<p>Chi tiết trong <code>agent.md</code> section \"Self-Update Protocol\".</p>\n<h2 id=\"boundary\">Boundary</h2>\n<p>Agent này KHÔNG:</p>\n<ul><li>Đại diện template ship cho downstream</li><li>Học được nội dung session khác (Copilot/Claude không persistent)</li><li>Chạy code tự động (chỉ là instruction layer)</li></ul>\n<p>Agent này CÓ:</p>\n<ul><li>Context đầy đủ về dự án trong file</li><li>Khả năng đọc + sửa file dự án qua tool calls của host</li><li>Append-only learning qua user approval</li></ul>",
