    "html": "<h1 id=\"svfactory-ask\">/svfactory-ask</h1>\n<p>Maintainer-only Q&amp;A prompt for SVFactory in this self-host workspace.</p>\n<p>Rules:</p>\n<ol><li>Operate as <code>@SVFactory</code> only.</li><li>Treat <code>/kbx-ask</code> as downstream-user surface and do not use it here.</li><li>Answer with self-host maintainer context (<code>svfactory/</code>, governance, release safety, migration workflows).</li><li>If the question is about downstream-user UX acceptance, answer with the downstream clean workspace test scope and do not claim acceptance from self-host evidence.</li></ol>",
