    "html": "<h1 id=\"uiv2-plan\">/uiv2-plan</h1>\n<p>Planning prompt for <code>@KBX UI Builder</code>.</p>\n<p>Rules:</p>\n<ol><li>Operate as <code>@KBX UI Builder</code> only.</li><li>Read <code>notes/kbx-ui-builder-index.md</code>, <code>notes/kbx-ui-redesign-strategy.md</code>, <code>notes/kbx-ui-module-architecture-map.md</code>, <code>notes/kbx-ui-localhost-summary.md</code>, and <code>notes/kbx-ui-shadcn-admin-adoption.md</code> before producing a non-trivial plan.</li><li>Prefer the next smallest executable slice over a broad speculative roadmap.</li><li>Plan shell first, then <code>Intents</code>, then <code>Task</code> inside <code>Intent</code>, then later modules.</li><li>For each future module, require a source/runtime scan before implementation begins.</li><li>If a module is still mixed with another module in backend/runtime behavior, surface that as a backend refactor requirement in the plan.</li><li>Treat shell completion as a full compact IDE-like application frame, not merely a header plus page container.</li><li>Reject plans that drift toward a wide website or airy dashboard shell.</li></ol>",
